eep `depth = 0`.\n   148\t- **Open boundary-frame dispatch (preserving generators in P1):**\n   149\t  - Both `py/gen-start` (`yang.python.antlr.prelude:471`) and `php/gen-start` (`yang.php.antlr.prelude:5312`) install `:generator` frames whose payload is `(fn [e] (gen-fail g e))`.\n   150\t  - Accordingly, `yrt.escape/raise` MUST dispatch `(if (= (get hs 0) :finally) ... ((get hs 1) e))` — treating `:finally` specially and delivering `e` to `(get hs 1)` for **every non-`:finally` frame kind** (`:handler`, `:generator`, etc.), never restricting allowed kinds to a closed two-kind check! Existing generators remain 100% compatible during P1 even before `yrt.gen` is extracted in P4.\n   151\t- **`restore!` invariant:** `(fn [ctx-cell saved] (cell/set! ctx-cell (assoc saved :base (get (cell/get ctx-cell) :base))))` — always preserves the activation's current `:base` across generator crossings.\n   152\t\n   153\t**Public exports:**\n   154\t\n   155\t| Export | Signature | Behavior |\n   156\t|---|---|---|\n   157\t| `ctx` | `[handlers depth base frame]` | Construct context record |\n   158\t| `handlers` / `set-handlers!` / `restore!` | `[ctx-cell ...]` | Context cell accessors/mutators (`restore!` preserves live `:base`) |\n   159\t| `frame-depth` / `frame` / `pop-frame` | `[hs]` / `[ctx-cell kind payload rest]` / `[ctx-cell hs]` | Frame construction and unwind pop (restoring `:handlers` and `:depth`) |\n   160\t| `raise` | `[ctx-cell e on-empty]` | Pop & invoke `:finally` frames passing `e`; invoke `(get hs 1)` on any non-`:finally` frame; call `(on-empty e)` if stack is empty (`py`/`js`/`clj` return a sentinel; `php` triggers `invariant-violation`) |\n   161\t| `unwind-to` | `[ctx-cell n normal-arg]` | Pop frames while `(> (get hs 3) n)`, running each `:finally` thunk with `normal-arg` (`:py/None`, `:js/undefined`, `:php/null`, `nil`) |\n   162\t| `abandon-to` | `[ctx-cell n]` | Pop frames while `(> (get hs 3) n)` **without** running `:finally` thunks (PHP terminal fatals / `exit`) |\n   163\t| `try-orelse` | `[ctx-cell body handler orelse]` | Install `:handler`; on normal exit restore and tail-call `(orelse)`; on escape restore and call `(handler r)` (`py`, `php`, `clj.py`) |\n   164\t| `try-value` | `[ctx-cell body handler]` | Install `:handler`; on normal exit restore and return `(body)`'s value directly (`js`, `clj`) |\n   165\t| `try-finally` | `[ctx-cell body fin normal-arg]` | Install `:finally`; on normal exit restore, run `(fin normal-arg)`, return `v` |\n   166\t| `call-ec` | `[ctx-cell f normal-arg]` | Capture escape continuation that runs `unwind-to` then `restore!` before invoking `r` |\n   167\t| `call-terminal` | `[ctx-cell f]` | Capture terminal escape that runs `abandon-to` then `restore!` before invoking `r` (`php`) |\n   168\t\nrg: src/cljc/yin/vm/cell.cljc: IO error for operation on src/cljc/yin/vm/cell.cljc: No such file or directory (os error 2)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
